epresentativeness":0.9258118271827698,"text_excerpt":"Who gets excited over a grocery store? I do! Because now if I need an item or two I don't have to go to Timbuktu or expensive Whole Foods to purchase it. Me and all my other neighbors now have the convenience of going right around the corner to Roberts and picking up whatever we need. Although not finished, like someone else commented, it has lots of potential. Full grocery store with all of your essentials, liquor store with premium liquor located inside, flower shop, and soon to be juice bar and PJ's. Whoop whoop. The prepared food section as well as the salad bar didn't look too bad either. People may complain about the prices, but let's be honest...the cost of living here is beginning..."},{"business_id":"1Vc_X9KoRX_YaaYUC268iA","review_id":"TckPgBYQBQlOKSNUdokOGA","date":"2018-07-02T19:32:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9221950769424438,"text_excerpt":"I love this location! The atmosphere and ambiance is amazing. I've been to this location several times and You're actually greeted when you walk in. May be a little pricey, but you get great food and service. I needed a quick fruit tray and stopped by to see if they had any, but I quickly found out that they were out. I spoke to Robert in the Fruit and Veggie department and whipped one up for me in 5 minutes while I shopped for other items. I'm always in there so if ya see me, just holla!"},{"business_id":"1Vc_X9KoRX_YaaYUC268iA","review_id":"VLL-aUmdl5qVg4pQk0n-Bg","date":"2017-12-30T18:47:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9199419617652893,"text_excerpt":"So happy there is now a grocery store in the neighborhood. Prices are in line with other stores locally (Rouses, Winn-Dixie). It just opened today so they're still getting set up, but very happy it's here."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"1Vc_X9KoRX_YaaYUC268iA","photo_id":"OKvAdPtbTgoTXQYuYkymqA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/OKvAdPtbTgoTXQYuYkymqA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.91